// BETA - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

// BETA is a language from Denmark, from before the popularity of
// objects. Its program is a pattern with an entry point.
%entry hello { output "Hello World!" }
